     sx5 is bound to the CONCRETE X5 value at s21 (word_sub (byte_len) 1),
     NOT `read X5 s21`: the cut's X5 POST `word_add (word_and sx5 _) sx0`
     must NOT reference an old state, or DISCARD_OLDSTATE drops it after
     ARM_BIGSTEP (see [[self_referential_post_for_arm_bigstep]]). *)
