     `ctr0 = word_join ctr_hi ctr_lo` (discharged via READ_MEMORY_BYTESIZED_
     SPLIT against the s21 ivec reads), then the main post-bigstep goal. *)
  ARM_BIGSTEP_TAC AES_GCM_MAIN_LOOP_PRELUDE_SLICE_EXEC "s145" THENL
   [MP_TAC(ISPECL[`memory`; `ivec_ptr:int64`; `s21:armstate`]
