(* Phase 11b Stage 2 (s151) — chain extension to s81 with Q4 spec form.      *)
(*                                                                           *)
(* Composes existing s71 chain endpoint                                      *)
(* `..._R45_2_GH2H_PLUS_Q10_PLUS_Q4Q8_PLUS_Q8_PLUS_Q0Q3_CORRECT` (line 22470)*)
(* with the new R4R5_BLOCK1_PLUS_Q4 leaf above (slice 72..81) to produce an *)
(* s81 endpoint that asserts Q4 = block-3 mid PMULL spec form in POST.      *)
(*                                                                           *)
(* Q4 spec form at s81 (from R4R5 leaf POST):                                *)
(*   pmul((rev64 q7_pre)_lo XOR ..._hi extracted via word_zx + word_subword,*)
(*        q16_lo)                                                            *)
(* = block-3 mid Karatsuba PMULL when q16_lo = karatsuba_mid (h_power 0).   *)
