(* spec POST" needs.  Subsequent levels (R45_03MID_X12, R45_2_GH2H_X12,      *)
(* R45_1_GH3H_X12, R56_0123_X12, R67_X12, R67_R8_X12, R67_R8_R78_2_MOD_X12,  *)
(* FULL_X12) extend the X12 self-ref through the chain — each upper level    *)
