(* cleanly via the ARM_VERBOSE_STEP "s60" + SUBGOAL_THEN inline pattern from *)
(* AES_GCM_PREPRETAIL_X12_SELF_REF_NO_PRE_CORRECT (s112, line 18847).        *)
(* See `[[arm-verbose-step-for-inline-extract]]` memory for the pattern.     *)
