(* Phase 11b G3 (s227) — LE_16 AES CTR wrapper (debt 5 step 4, per-band tail).*)
(*                                                                            *)
(* Spec-anchored sibling of ..._LE_16_BODY_FUNCTIONAL_CLOSED_AES_CORRECT.     *)
(* Imports the concrete-X12 N0_BODY_AES_WITH_Q11_KERNEL_CTR cut (block-4       *)
(* native counter `base+4`, base = word_bytereverse(word_subword ctr0(96,32)))*)
(* instead of the opaque self-ref, drops the `sx12_e` ABBREV, and instantiates *)
(* the TAIL_N1 `sx12` arg to the concrete `base+4`.  The near-vacuous `?cf`  *)
(* counter-cell POST conjunct is REPLACED by the spec-anchored cell            *)
(*   word_subword(word_zx(word_bytereverse(word_subword                       *)
(*     (aes_gcm_ctr_at (word_bytereverse ctr0) 1) (0,32)))) (0,32)            *)
(* The closer rewrites the propagated TAIL_N1 cell `word_sub (base+4)(word 3)`*)
(* = `word_add base (word 1)` (WORD_RULE) then applies AES_GCM_CTR_CELL_AS_SPEC.*)
(* This pins G3 (counter) to the spec for the LE band, block k=1.            *)
(* Recipe: [[g3_counter_cell_threading_recipe]] + [[g3_debt5_counter_pinning_structural]].*)
