(* Phase 11b Stage 3 (s166) — C2-LE_32 closed functional theorem (N=2).       *)
(*                                                                            *)
(* Strengthens AES_GCM_ENC_KERNEL_BYTE_LEN_LE_32_BODY_FUNCTIONAL_CORRECT by   *)
(* witnessing prev_tag = word_bytereverse(initial_tag).  Mirrors the s140     *)
