(*   4. Goal MAYCHANGE adds `bytes128 (cptr_tail+48)` for the fourth        *)
(*      ciphertext block; nonoverlapping (ptr0_tail, 64) and                *)
(*      (cptr_tail, 64) (was 48 each).                                      *)
