(* === byte_len > 128 4-way GT_128 combinator (s117) === *)
(* Unifies the four per-N (N=1..4) byte_len > 128 wrappers
 * (BYTE_LEN_GT_128_LE_{16,32,48,64}_CORRECT) into a single ensures
 * over the full byte_len > 128 range with tail length 1..64.
