 * dispatched via MP_TAC(SPECL[...] sub_wrapper) + ANTS_TAC + DISCH_TAC,
 * then ENSURES_FRAME_SUBSUMED widens the MAYCHANGE frame, and
 * ENSURES_PRECONDITION_THM (with EXISTS_TAC of the sub-wrapper PRE)
 * weakens the goal's wider PRE to the sub-wrapper's narrower PRE.
