(* ============================================================================
 * Phase 10 (s132) — Path (c) Step 7 (FINAL): SUBROUTINE wrapper.
 *
 * Hand-rolled tactic (does NOT use ARM_ADD_RETURN_STACK_TAC because the body
 * unifier's variable order — stackpointer at position 9 of 44 vars — does not
 * match what WORD_FORALL_OFFSET_TAC expects: see s130 / s131 logs).
 *
 * Strategy: SPECL stackpointer directly without the offset shift; body's PRE
 * has SP = `word_sub stackpointer (word 128)` already, matching the
 * post-prologue state at s11 exactly. Adds 5 nonoverlapping conditions to the
 * wrapper PRE (cptr/cptr+64/cptr_tail/xiptr/ivec_ptr+12 vs the 128-byte stack
 * frame) for stack memory propagation through ARM_BIGSTEP_TAC.
 *
 * Final SUBSUMED close: substitute `cptr_tail = word_add cptr ...` first, so
 * the LHS `bytes128 cptr_tail` matches the RHS `bytes128 (word_add cptr ...)`
 * — without this substitution, SUBSUMED_MAYCHANGE_TAC's atomic-step matcher
 * cannot bridge the symbolic abbreviation.
