(* ============================================================================
 * Phase 11b G3 (s240) — debt-5 step-5: LE-path (byte_len<=64) band combinator,
 * X12-anchored counter variant.
 *
 * Clone of AES_GCM_ENC_KERNEL_BYTE_LEN_LE_64_BODY_FUNCTIONAL_CLOSED_AES_CORRECT
 * (the self-ref combinator @84490, left untouched per clone-don't-mutate) that
 * merges the four spec-anchored _AES_CTR tail leaves
 * (..._LE_{16,32,48,64_4}_BODY_FUNCTIONAL_CLOSED_AES_CTR_CORRECT, s226/s227)
 * instead of the vacuous-?cf self-ref leaves.
 *
 * POST delta vs the self-ref combinator: the single top-level band-independent
 * `?cf` counter cell is REPLACED by four band-GUARDED concrete counter cells
 * `read(ivec+12) = word_subword(word_zx(word_bytereverse(word_subword
 *   (aes_gcm_ctr_at (word_bytereverse ctr0) k) (0,32))))(0,32)` with k=N
 * (1/2/3/4 for N=1/2/3/4).  The LE path SKIPS firstblocks (b.ge 0x244), so its
 * X12 is concrete base+N with NO +4*iters loop term (per
 * [[g3_wider_bands_use_firstblocks_prepretail_spine]]) — simpler than GT_128
 * (which carries base+8+4*M).  No `ctr0 = word_join ctr_hi ctr_lo` PRE needed
 * (unlike GT_128 — the LE leaves don't require it).
 *
 * Proof delta: only the four leaf MP names swapped to _AES_CTR_CORRECT.  The
 * uniform per-arm discharge (REPEAT CONJ_TAC THEN DISCH_TAC THEN
 * TRY(FIRST_ASSUM ACCEPT_TAC) THEN SUBGOAL_THEN F ...) closes the new guarded
 * counter conjuncts exactly as it closes the guarded GHASH existentials: active
 * band from the leaf's concrete cell, inactive bands by band contradiction.
 * ============================================================================ *)

