(* Phase 11b G1 (s202) — per-N GT_128 AES body wrappers.                     *)
(*                                                                           *)
(* GT_128 mirror of the (64,128] band AES body wrappers (s196/s197).  Each   *)
(* clones the GT_128 non-AES LE_{16,32,48,64} body wrapper, swapping the     *)
(* Stage-1 MP to the s201 prepretail AES spine                               *)
(* (..._GT_128_PRELUDE_MAIN_LOOP_PREPRETAIL_STRONG_X12_NIST_BODY_WITH_Q11_AES_CORRECT) *)
(* and the Stage-2 MP to the FUNCTIONAL_CPTR tail (cptr-passthrough), so the *)
(* 4 firstblocks ciphertext cells (cptr blocks 0..3, in AES spec form)       *)
(* survive the tail bigstep.  POST exposes cptr+0/16/32/48 = pt_k XOR        *)
(* rev(aes128_cipher ctr_k ks_fips) AND the anchored GHASH tag at xiptr.     *)
