(* Wraps AES_GCM_ENC_KERNEL_BYTE_LEN_64_TO_128_BODY_FUNCTIONAL_CLOSED_AES_CORRECT*)
(* (@71210) with byte_list_at-form per-block ciphertext POST conjuncts for the*)
(* 4 firstblocks (0..3, unconditional in this band).  GHASH tag bands + G3 ?cf*)
(* carried verbatim.  Tail keystream (blocks 4..7) stays unpinned existential *)
(* (carried debt).  Per-block EMIT ciphertext read at cptr+16k converted via  *)
(* PRESENT_CT_BLOCK_AT at block index k.                                       *)
